            "notes": "[Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) gives even more value to Swift Step, since we'll be reducing its cooldown and using it to heal our team thanks to  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b). This is not necessarily meant to be a sneaky DPS flank-enabling device in this build. Play with your team, and use Swift Step to heal while the clone distracts the enemy.\n\nIf you noticed you were cleansing a lot of statuses the prior round (keep an eye on your per-round stats),  [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) can be a good alternate choice for your power to help charge your ult faster.\n\nTry for both cooldown-reducing blue items ( [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) ), but if you can't afford both, just do one.",
